1
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,000
Mumu,

2
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,640
come out.

3
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,560
Look what I bought for you.

4
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:25,600
Mumu.

5
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,360
Mumu.

6
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:35,600
Mumu.

7
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:44,800
Annie found where you were hiding,

8
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,280
and took away Mumu.

9
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,760
Didn't you promise me

10
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,720
to hold Annie back

11
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,560
while I was in the country?

12
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:53,040
Annie didn't take Mumu back to the old house,

13
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:54,440
but hid her.

14
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,280
At least now, if you want to get Mumu back,

15
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,560
you have to rely on yourself.

16
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,640
After you get Mumu back,

17
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,440
I can arrange for you to go to Malaysia.

18
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,640
You said you would lead me to the right path,

19
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:23,680
but I have lived in the abyss since I was born.

20
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,400
I'm sorry.

21
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,880
In the end, you still have to see

22
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:32,080
I become the monster I hate.

23
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,280
Only in this way can I defeat Annie.

24
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,360
Excuse me, are you Miss Jiang Li?

25
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,760
Yes, I am.

26
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,200
Oh.

27
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,000
Jiang Li.

28
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,000
You are more beautiful than the photos Jingmo stole.

29
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,040
Like a sharp dagger from the Warring States period.

30
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,000
No wonder

31
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,600
Jingmo is so persistent about you.

32
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:11,360
Grandfather Shen, you are in such a good mood.

33
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:13,520
Your grandson is in a coma in the hospital,

34
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:16,480
yet you're here fishing koi fish with ease.

35
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:21,920
Oh,

36
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:22,720
what a pity.

37
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:24,200
Oh,

38
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:24,680
what a pity.

39
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:27,320
I thought I'd catch a big fish.

40
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:30,040
Oh,

41
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:30,840
no need.

42
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,520
Ah,

43
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:40,040
Shen Family men stick to their goals,

44
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,440
no matter how hard it is.

45
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,320
Among all the young men,

46
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,880
I like Jingmo the most.

47
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,000
Yeah.

48
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:50,800
Because he has that kind of spirit.

49
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:51,880
Hmph.

50
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:53,640
He's just like me back then.

51
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:57,520
I don't pity him.

52
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:58,960
Ah.

53
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:01,840
You don't have to feel guilty.

54
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:04,360
If you're not here to blame me,

55
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,400
what do you want from me?

56
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,880
I'll buy all the properties of the Lu Family

57
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:10,560
and give them to you

58
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,800
as a dowry.

59
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,640
When Jingmo wakes up,

60
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,240
you two get married

61
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,680
and live a happy life.

62
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,440
It's not good for you and Jingmo

63
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,080
to keep

64
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:21,880
chasing the past.

65
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,680
I appreciate your kindness,

66
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,600
but this incident

67
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,960
made me realize something.

68
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:30,280
Between Shen Jingmo and me, there's the blood he didn't spill

69
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,360
and the revenge I haven't completed.

70
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:35,080
I accepted his love,

71
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,480
but made him pay a price he shouldn't have.

72
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:40,080
So I decided to let go of this love.

73
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:42,760
Because when I pull the demon into the abyss,

74
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:43,920
I can't take him with me.

75
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,080
Girl,

76
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:46,560
you are as crazy

77
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,600
as Jingmo's grandmother.

78
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,760
If I were 50 years younger,

79
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:51,560
maybe

80
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,760
I would be Jingmo's rival in love.

81
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:54,400
Ah,

82
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:56,920
Grandpa Shen is really

83
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:59,240
as humorous as Shen Jingmo said.

84
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,240
When his grandmother split open

85
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,000
the door of the boardroom with an axe,

86
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:06,640
her eyes were also ablaze with the same fiery light as yours.

87
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:09,280
If you have any difficulties, come to me anytime.

88
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,320
This is for you.

89
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,320
What is this?

90
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:02,480
This is Shen Jingmo's trump card for you.

91
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,640
How do you have this?

92
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:20,080
Because Shen Jingmo anticipated everything that might happen.

93
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:23,160
He said your path to revenge was too dark,

94
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,680
and you needed to leave a light.

95
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:32,160
Aren't you afraid that I might betray you and Jiang Li

96
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,880
for money?

97
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:34,800
You know,

98
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,040
money is just a number

99
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:36,880
to me.

100
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,520
But you need atonement,

101
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,160
for yourself

102
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:43,080
and for the child in your belly.

103
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,840
So what do you want me to do?

104
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,080
This is a copy of all the materials.

105
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:52,560
I don't believe Jenny, a coward,

106
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,760
would easily tell Jiang Li where the materials are.

107
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:55,920
You suspect

108
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:58,040
Jenny also told Annie

109
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:58,880
what you were doing?

110
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:00,720
Jenny is a selfish person.

111
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,880
Everything revolves around her own interests.

112
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,560
For her,

113
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:07,000
rather than getting involved in the vortex,

114
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:09,080
it's better to tell both sides.

115
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,600
No matter which side wins,

116
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,760
she can profit from it.

117
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:15,080
Now that you already know,

118
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:17,240
why do you want me to keep this copy?

119
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:19,160
[Jiang Li's path to revenge is too dark,]

120
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,400
[I have to leave her a light.]

121
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:24,360
[And the file in your hand is the last trump card.]

122
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,800
[And you will do anything]

123
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,240
[to cover up the truth.]

124
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:29,640
[If I don't come back,]

125
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,520
[just give this to Jiang Li.]

126
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,440
You really don't plan to tell Jiang Li

127
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:37,960
why you help her at all costs?

128
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,880
If something really happens to you one day,

129
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:42,000
she will live a life of regret.

130
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:45,080
My notebook is in this file.

131
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,960
I was bullied because I was fat again.

132
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,800
Grandpa, the big bad guy, doesn't help me.

133
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:12,960
I'm so angry.

134
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,160
I'm so angry.

135
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,760
I'll beat you.

136
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,920
You are disobedient.

137
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,200
Stop.

138
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,720
The wild girl is coming. Run.

139
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:25,960
Run.

140
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:30,000
But today is different.

141
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,360
She said her name is Su Muli.

142
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:34,040
She not only helped me,

143
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,960
but also wanted to be my friend.

144
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,440
Alright.

145
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,680
A man should learn to protect himself.

146
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,400
You are so fat.

147
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,160
If you have the same courage as me,

148
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,680
you can be the leader of the children.

149
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:52,800
Alright.

150
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:56,640
You must be bullied because you cry too much.

151
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:58,040
You are a boy.

152
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,560
You should protect girls

153
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:01,200
when you grow up.

154
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,560
If you keep crying,

155
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,480
no girl will like you

156
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,440
when you grow up.

157
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:10,080
How did you get the scar on your hand?

158
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:14,640
I scratched it when I climbed out of a deep hole.

159
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:15,840
It doesn't matter.

160
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,960
My name is Su Muli.

161
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:17,920
What's your name?

162
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,480
My name is Shen...

163
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,400
Come on, you're so slow.

164
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:25,120
I'll call you Shen Xiaopang.

165
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,480
From now on,

166
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,840
I'll protect you.

167
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,680
If anyone bullies you,

168
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:31,520
come to the orphanage and find me.

169
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:32,720
Okay.

170
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,760
Su Mulili is my first friend,

171
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:40,960
and the only friend I have.

172
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:47,160
That summer,

173
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:50,480
She was a butterfly in my black-and-white world.

174
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:54,000
With the scar and the sunflower band-aid,

175
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:57,880
She was my childhood's only reason to laugh.

176
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:02,200
And she was the one I swore to protect

177
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,520
when I grew up.

178
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,440
But she was like a meteor in a summer night.

179
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:28,360
She disappeared before I had a chance to make a wish.

180
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:32,120
It's as if she had never appeared in my world.

181
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,400
She was as beautiful as a dream.

182
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:37,600
The past always has to be put down.

183
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:40,720
The journey of life is like a speeding car,

184
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,720
which needs to continue along the road called time.

185
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,240
But fate

186
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,800
becomes a speed bump on this journey.

187
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:50,680
The freshman ball is a hunting ground.

188
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:53,280
With your face and the background of Shen Family,

189
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:55,320
the Parisian socialites will fight for you.

190
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:58,360
I'm really not interested in these.

191
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,080
Who is she?

192
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,240
Su Muli,

193
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:07,440
A genius in the Department of Costume Design.

194
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:09,480
Charles's closed disciple.

195
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:11,920
I advise you not to have any thoughts.

196
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:17,080
An oil prince covered her dorm steps with a diamond necklace.

197
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:20,160
She directly reported him for sexual harassment.

198
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:23,800
Fate is like the interlaced lines on her drawing board.

199
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,880
After many years,

200
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:28,920
I finally found the sunflower girl I lost.

201
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:32,000
It's like a kite that has gone away after breaking the line.

202
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:35,400
Suddenly appears on the old tree at the doorstep.

203
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,080
Full of surprise and joy.

204
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,560
But because the old tree is too tall,

205
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:45,320
I just look daily for wind.

206
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:47,120
which can make it fall down

207
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,280
and come back to me.

208
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:13,120
Hey, beauty.

209
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,120
What's up, beauty?

210
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,560
Do you want to play with us?

211
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,120
What are you doing?

212
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,680
Come on, let's go.

213
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:17,960
Do you dare to play with us?

214
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,520
Let's go.

215
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:22,640
Hi.

216
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:06,640
Su Muli

217
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,240
Why do you smell so much of alcohol?

218
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:09,920
Wake up.

219
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:12,320
You are drunk. I'll take you back to the dormitory.

220
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,200
You men

221
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,520
all say sweet words with the mask of the devil.

222
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:18,840
Zhou Jian

223
00:13:19,760 --> 00:13:22,240
I'll ruin you and the Lu family.

224
00:13:23,800 --> 00:13:24,960
But I don't have the courage.

225
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:26,960
because I'm afraid of being rejected,

226
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:29,360
I never dare to get close to her.

227
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:32,280
I only dare to stand in the corner and watch her.

228
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,160
I guard her

229
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,640
and fulfill the oath I made alone in childhood.

230
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:38,840
I'm sorry.

231
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:40,880
I'm sorry.

232
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:42,320
I'm sorry.

233
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:43,920
You are

234
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:47,320
the junior who always peeps at me in the library.

235
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:50,400
Tell me,

236
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,960
who bullied you?

237
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,080
I'll crush them for you.

238
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:01,320
Maybe it was just her impulse after drinking.

239
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,000
Maybe she didn't remember anything

240
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,080
after she sobered up the next day.

241
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,240
But for me,

242
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,600
giving my first kiss to the girl I love

243
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:11,200
is a happy thing.

244
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:13,600
From then on,

245
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,520
I decided to face my heart with courage.

246
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,560
I walked to the riverbank with the flowers in my arms,

247
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:21,440
just like holding the hairpin I didn't dare to give her.

248
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,320
This time, I'm going to tell her

249
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:27,600
Shen Xiaopang has grown up to be someone who can protect her.

250
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,120
Hi.

251
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:33,640
Where's Su Muli? She didn't come to sketch today.

252
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:35,000
She dropped out of school.

253
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:39,840
Fate cut the thread again before I could speak.

254
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,920
We are like two ships that will never meet.

255
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:47,360
Even the lighthouse is stingy to give us intersecting light.

256
00:14:58,120 --> 00:15:00,080
Fate is like a despicable magician.

257
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:03,560
who took my sunflower girl away a few years ago,

258
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:08,040
now puts Lu Xu's engagement ring on her,

259
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:10,920
and pushes her back into my world.

260
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,320
But this time, no matter what,

261
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,240
I want to try.

262
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:39,280
Because the crybaby in my heart twenty years ago

263
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:41,200
tells me in the depths of my soul

264
00:15:42,280 --> 00:15:44,120
that this is the last chance God gives you.

265
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:57,480
I know what you are doing.

266
00:15:57,880 --> 00:15:58,680
Jiang Li.

267
00:15:59,120 --> 00:15:59,920
Su Mulie.

268
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:02,880
I don't expect to be the protagonist of your life,

269
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:04,960
but can you add a supporting role called Shen Jingmo

270
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:07,840
in your revenge script?
